  "solution": "Given equation: 286 ÷ 13 × 2 + 50 - 6 = 0\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/7751840ca1840d12cadc428f84d30e2cdcd5e7f82d52a57de21f2404c58eed88.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) + and ×\n\nGiven: 286 ÷ 13 × 2 + 50 - 6 = 0\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get:\n\n⇒ __**286 ÷ 13**__ + 2 × 50 - 6 = 0\n\n⇒ 22 + __**2 **____**×**____** 50**__ - 6 = 0\n\n⇒ __**22 + 100**____** **__- 6 = 0\n\n⇒ __**122 - 6**__ \n\n⇒ 116 ≠ 0\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n**Option 2) + and -**\n\nGiven: 286 ÷ 13 × 2 + 50 - 6 = 0\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get:\n\n⇒ __**286 ÷ 13**__ × 2 - 50 + 6 = 0\n\n⇒ __**22 × 2**__ - 50 + 6 = 0\n\n⇒ __**44**__ - 50 __**+ 6**__ = 0\n\n⇒ __**50 - 50**__ = 0\n\n⇒ **LHS = RHS**\n\nOption 3) ÷ and ×\n\nGiven: 286 ÷ 13 × 2 + 50 - 6 = 0\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get:\n\n⇒ 286 × __**13 ÷ 2**__ + 50 - 6 = 0\n\n⇒ __**286 × 6.5**__ + 50 - 6 = 0\n\n⇒ __**1859 + 50**__ - 6 = 0\n\n⇒ __**1909 - 6 **__= 0\n\n⇒ 1903 ≠ 0\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) - and ×\n\nGiven: 286 ÷ 13 × 2 + 50 - 6 = 0\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get:\n\n⇒ __**286 ÷ 13**__ - 2 + 50 × 6 = 0\n\n⇒ 22 - 2 + __**50 × 6**__ = 0\n\n⇒ __**22**__ - 2 __**+ 300**__ = 0\n\n⇒ __**322 - 2**__\n\n⇒ 320 ≠ 0\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS",
